Cat Clip Composer v0.1.19

This file has no added file-type extension and is the distributable version marker. Its filename must match the application version.

Changes since v0.1.18:
- Shortened ordinary startup progress-line pacing to 50–100 milliseconds.
- Replaced the five-second minimum splash duration with 200–500 millisecond opening and completion holds.
- Applied the same short boundary holds to manual library-refresh splashes without delaying live scan updates.
